CDISK,	0			/PHOONEY RETURN
CDISKC,	DCA	CDISK		/SAVE RETURN ADDRESS.
	CLA CMA			/CLEAR THE RK08 STATUS REGISTER
	DCLS
	CLA			/NOW CLEAR THE AC
	TAD	CDIL70		/PLACE A 70 IN THE AC TO SEE IF THE RK08 IS THERE
	DLDC			/SEND TO THE CONTROLLER
	CLA			/CLEAR AC IN CASE IOT WAS A NOP
	DRDC			/NOW READ BACK IN COMMAND REGISITER
	CIA			/NEGATE IT
	TAD	CDIL70		/TEST TO SEE IF STILL THERE
	SNA CLA			/HOW ABOUT IT.
	JMP	CRK08		/REG IS GOOD. WEVE GOT AN RK08
/
	DCMA			/BAM. CLEAR DISK
	DCMA			/ONE MORE TIME FOR GOOD MEASURE
	TAD	L77		/A DISK ADDRESS.
	DXAL			/SEND IT OUT
	CLA			/CLEAR THE AC TO BE SURE
	DXAC			/READ IT BACK???
	CIA
	TAD	L77		/ALL WELL?
	SNA CLA			/???
	JMS	DSET		/SET UP FOR THE DISKS NOW???
	CLA CMA			/MINUS 1 FOR THE COUNT.
	JMP I	CDISK		/RETURN
