/
/	THE FIRST PART IS A LITTLE CALLING ROUTINE WHICH INTERPRETS THE CALLS FROM PIPS MASS STOREAGE ROUTINES.
/	AND PROTECTS LOCATIONS 7400-7777 FROM THE DISK ZAPPING THEM.
