	AND	L7		/CHOP OFF THE HIGH ORDER CRAP
	SNA			/ZERO???
	IAC			/YEP. MAKE 1 COPY ONLY
	CIA
	DCA	AAMHOW		/STASH AWAY NUMBER TO MAKE
