				/THESE NEXT DEFINITIONS ARE DEFINED AS
				/AUTO-INDEX REGISTERS BECAUSE OF SPACE
				/REQUIREMENTS. NO ROUTINE WHICH WE CALL
				/WILL TOUCH THEM. BECAREFUL OF THIS
				/IN THE FUTURE, IF DISPLAY OR CHECKIO
				/SHOULD EVER NEED TO USE THEM.
